(e)
the remuneration, fee or allowances of associated person under sub-section (3) of section 12;
(f)
any other matter under clause (f) of sub-section (4) of section 12;
(g)
the form of application, the particulars it shall contain and the documents it shall accompany, under sub-section (1) of
section 15;
(h)
the salary and allowances payable to and other terms and conditions of service of Chairperson and other Members,
under section 22;
(i)
the powers of Chairperson under section 29;
(j)
the salary and allowances payable to and the terms and other conditions of service of officers and other employees of
the Commission, under sub-section (2) of section 30;
(k)
the form of application, the particulars it shall contain and the documents it shall accompany, under sub-section (1) of
section 31;
(l)
any other matter under clause (f) of sub-section (5) of section 32;
(m)
the form and the time for preparing annual report by the Commission under section 37;
(n)
the manner of transfer of officers and other employees of the Commission under clause (c) of sub-section (2) of section
